Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請吃早餐
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.62,0:00:08.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.02,0:00:17.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好好吃！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.55,0:00:22.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了改善你們的飲食 我準備了餐點
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然做的不算完美
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.70,0:00:26.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才沒那種事喔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.92,0:00:30.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 很好吃喔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 謝謝妳
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.07,0:00:33.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真不錯呢
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.35,0:00:36.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我偶爾也來做個飯好了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.20,0:00:38.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不 妳不用勉強自己去做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪醬想成為家人）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個緣司出門了 暫時不會回來
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.70,0:02:15.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（我要開動了）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那傢伙以為我不會煮菜
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.72,0:02:20.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我要做頓大餐
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,他等著瞧吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這句話有“教訓對方”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.85,0:02:26.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“給對方好看”之類的意思
Dialogue: 2,0:02:26.90,0:02:27.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不建議這麼做
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是啦不是啦
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.27,0:02:31.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是要讓他覺得超好吃啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:35.22,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（簡單又美味）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.77,0:02:37.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是要做法簡單
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,料理什麼的只要依照食譜就沒問題
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.17,0:02:49.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我還以為自己做得不錯
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再… 再試一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:18.57,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪方陣快砲，會自動擊落危險的近距離物體）
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.35,0:03:15.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可隨便瞄準他人
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.07,0:03:17.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,您沒事吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.27,0:03:18.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝… 謝謝
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.50,0:03:22.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,您習慣在切食材時閉著眼睛
Dialogue: 2,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太害怕了就…
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.47,0:03:30.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,菜刀跟瓦斯爐都是工具
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.82,0:03:33.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只要小心地使用就很安全
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,放心 一點都不可怕喔
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.72,0:03:38.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,您才是媽媽啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.20,0:03:45.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有其他需要改掉的地方嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.87,0:03:48.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,常常不照食譜做 太隨意了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:48.40,0:03:50.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有爐火總是開得太大
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.55,0:03:52.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也做不到細微的調整
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.32,0:03:54.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只是在旁邊看就知道這麼多啊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.07,0:03:58.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我正在收集古今東西各種料理的資料
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.82,0:04:00.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好好喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.45,0:04:03.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,比如正確的菜刀握法是這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.02,0:04:04.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.50,0:04:06.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,然後輔助手要這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.27,0:04:09.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,像貓爪的手勢
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.20,0:04:12.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呀 好可愛
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.15,0:04:14.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請仔細看手勢
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.80,0:04:16.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.70,0:04:17.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這… 這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.05,0:04:18.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.92,0:04:21.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,冷靜 慢慢地
Dialogue: 2,0:04:26.85,0:04:27.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,做到了！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.02,0:04:29.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真厲害呢
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.42,0:04:31.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,跟剛才完全不同
Dialogue: 2,0:04:31.52,0:04:32.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對呀
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只要我想就能做到喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.80,0:04:39.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好 再來就依這步調解決一個個問題
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,眼睛…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.15,0:04:44.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,您沒事吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,切到手指了！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太用力了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.80,0:05:01.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感覺能成功呢！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別用那種眼神看啦
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.77,0:05:17.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗚… 好苦
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.70,0:05:18.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.95,0:05:23.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,現在有很多種取得食物的方法
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.60,0:05:26.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為什麼堅持自己親手做呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.20,0:05:28.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那傢伙
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.05,0:05:32.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯好吃
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那傢伙
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.75,0:05:38.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也想要讓那傢伙
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.97,0:05:43.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感到高興也說不定
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.55,0:05:45.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,高興
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.47,0:05:49.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊！這些話別跟他說喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.47,0:05:52.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是說要保密呢
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.80,0:05:54.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好 再試一次！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.77,0:05:57.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會盡力幫忙的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,兩人不斷苦戰
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:17.35,0:06:18.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.37,0:06:21.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這… 這個嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.65,0:06:24.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 請吃看看
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.05,0:06:25.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.25,0:06:34.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難道又是阿爾瑪做的嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.67,0:06:36.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我超喜歡漢堡排
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.82,0:06:41.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不 這是媽媽為爸爸親手做的料理
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請分享感想
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.52,0:06:46.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-唔… 呃嗯\N-等等
Dialogue: 2,0:06:47.07,0:06:48.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽她
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.30,0:06:50.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了讓爸爸稱讚好吃
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.52,0:06:51.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,努力做飯了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.70,0:06:55.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然一開始總是做不出美味料理
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.60,0:06:58.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但就算失敗也不停止挑戰
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.82,0:07:00.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,提升了廚藝
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.75,0:07:03.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪說的… 是真的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.45,0:07:10.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很… 很好吃喔
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.35,0:07:18.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了親自做料理而努力的情境
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.35,0:07:21.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不管找哪種藉口 都是出自喜歡嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.20,0:07:26.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然很高興能吃到小雀親手做的菜
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.37,0:07:28.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但她為什麼突然這樣做？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.47,0:07:32.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呵呵呵… 我知道了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.07,0:07:35.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是為了讓阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.92,0:07:40.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,體會一家和樂圍在餐桌\N吃飯的計畫對吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:40.95,0:07:42.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你… 你真敏銳呢
Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.22,0:07:45.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快 快點趁熱吃吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.92,0:07:46.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是這樣一來
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.37,0:08:04.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪沒有進食功能就顯得怪怪的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:04.57,0:08:08.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯 如果吃了有機物\N可能會嚴重故障
Dialogue: 2,0:08:09.60,0:08:10.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.27,0:08:12.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪妳怎麼啦？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.45,0:08:14.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-難道說吃掉了\N-啊… 啊啊啊
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.85,0:08:16.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嘴巴好像沾了東西！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快 阿爾瑪 快吐出來 快！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.27,0:08:20.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.35,0:08:25.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,後來在當晚就增加了進食功能
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.25,0:08:35.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我做的炒飯很好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:50.25,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.50,0:08:44.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我吃飽了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.02,0:08:48.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,全家一起吃 更加美味
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.35,0:09:02.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,偵測到壓力值增加了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:03.12,0:09:05.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 您沒事吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.65,0:09:06.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.82,0:09:10.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,承接的工作有著難以解決的疑慮
Dialogue: 2,0:09:10.80,0:09:12.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想集中精神處理
Dialogue: 2,0:09:12.50,0:09:13.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳能保持安靜嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.00,0:09:16.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我知道了 您請加油
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.77,0:09:32.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,物體掃描
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,確認為某種掃地機器人
Dialogue: 2,0:09:41.12,0:09:42.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想集中精神處理
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.85,0:09:44.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳能保持安靜嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.67,0:09:48.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,保持安靜… 保持安靜… 保持安靜…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:07.97,0:10:10.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,恐對任務造成阻礙
Dialogue: 2,0:10:11.20,0:10:12.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,將立即予以逮捕
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.57,0:10:25.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啟動逮捕專用附加裝置
Dialogue: 2,0:10:49.02,0:10:51.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪不好意思啊 已經沒問題了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:53.85,0:10:54.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,電池電量不足
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.42,0:11:02.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只是要妳保持安靜
Dialogue: 2,0:11:02.40,0:11:04.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼會花了這麼多能量呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.85,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（神里緣司 夜羽雀 研究室）
Dialogue: 2,0:11:26.05,0:11:27.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽 歡迎回家
Dialogue: 2,0:11:30.45,0:11:32.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？阿爾瑪 那是
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好懷念喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:36.00,0:11:38.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是我和那傢伙最初\N試做的掃地機器人嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是兩位製作的機器人嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:42.07,0:11:42.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.05,0:11:44.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不明原因的異常動作
Dialogue: 2,0:11:44.95,0:11:46.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結果還是修不好啊
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.90,0:11:48.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 2,0:11:49.47,0:11:50.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要這麼說的話
Dialogue: 2,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳有很多哥哥喔
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.95,0:11:54.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也就是“兒女成群”呢
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.35,0:11:57.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.67,0:12:01.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呃 只是在舉例
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.85,0:12:04.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,兄妹嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:12.72,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:06.45,0:12:08.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,後來跟哥哥一起玩耍
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.22,0:12:10.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是要好的兄妹呢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:15.35,0:12:18.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉… 整理不完啊
Dialogue: 2,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既然有阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:12:20.25,0:12:22.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總不能一直是這種狀態吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.35,0:12:24.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼態度嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:12:24.72,0:12:27.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你也沒在整理呀
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我只是把必要物品
Dialogue: 2,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,放在容易拿到的地方而已
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.32,0:12:33.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別混為一談
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸在前陣子
Dialogue: 2,0:12:36.90,0:12:41.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,花了1小時42分才找到東西
Dialogue: 2,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有個聰慧的女兒真是太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哦 有客人
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.57,0:12:50.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:51.65,0:12:53.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥 你還活著！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.57,0:12:56.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小時
Dialogue: 2,0:13:00.47,0:13:03.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！緊急指令SS警報！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.70,0:13:05.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:13:07.10,0:13:08.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼了啊啊啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:09.00,0:13:10.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啟動隱形系統
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:15.17,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪無蹤，以特殊粒子包覆，折射可見光，是完美的光學迷彩）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,隱藏… 無法見人的東西
Dialogue: 2,0:13:15.45,0:13:17.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等等剛才那是誰啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:17.50,0:13:19.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我妹 神里時
Dialogue: 2,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥
Dialogue: 2,0:13:22.10,0:13:23.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我進來囉
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.40,0:13:24.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喂… 等一下
Dialogue: 2,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我沒叫妳就別進來啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:29.42,0:13:30.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對不起嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:13:32.65,0:13:34.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼這麼亂呀
Dialogue: 2,0:13:34.82,0:13:36.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,剛好正在整理啦
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是說妳來幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.87,0:13:41.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為大哥
Dialogue: 2,0:13:41.37,0:13:43.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,從以前就是只要一沉浸在喜愛的事物
Dialogue: 2,0:13:43.70,0:13:46.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就會好幾天都不吃飯不是嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:13:46.65,0:13:49.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最近都沒有回去老家
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.22,0:13:51.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我擔心你是不是還活著
Dialogue: 2,0:13:52.47,0:13:53.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你吃飯了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.35,0:13:54.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,吃了…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.65,0:13:56.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大學呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒怎麼去…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.50,0:14:01.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦咦 好不容易進了好地方
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.52,0:14:02.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳好煩啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.10,0:14:05.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳是怎麼知道這裡的啦
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.67,0:14:07.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我問了媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.87,0:14:08.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妹妹？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.87,0:14:09.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 2,0:14:10.57,0:14:14.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我來應付她 妳們繼續躲著
Dialogue: 2,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸？為什麼要這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.27,0:14:18.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就配合我一次吧
Dialogue: 2,0:14:18.65,0:14:21.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是為了我們… 不 為了阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:14:21.02,0:14:22.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,知道啦你靠太近了！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你是沒看到嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.52,0:14:25.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱… 抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是很麻煩的人嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.05,0:14:30.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不… 是很單純的好孩子喔
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.17,0:14:32.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你是說你妹？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我就是在說我妹
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.97,0:14:36.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪的事情
Dialogue: 2,0:14:37.07,0:14:39.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想要盡量避免被“外部人士”知道
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.85,0:14:41.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“千里之堤 潰於蟻穴”
Dialogue: 2,0:14:42.32,0:14:45.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,裂縫越小 越該嚴謹看待
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.87,0:14:46.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,更重要的是…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:46.77,0:14:49.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她絕對會誤以為我們有不正當關係
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.35,0:14:52.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸？大哥的女朋友？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.30,0:14:55.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,跟你成為家人認可的情侶
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.92,0:14:57.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那真的是很困擾啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.02,0:15:00.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,幸好只要“沒有劇烈動作”
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,隱形系統就萬無一失！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.20,0:15:05.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了盡量平穩地讓妹妹回家
Dialogue: 2,0:15:06.25,0:15:08.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,家人們要同心協力才行呢
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呵呵呵… 沒錯！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.02,0:15:12.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,同心協力吧 因為我們是“家人”
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.15,0:15:16.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是啊 這是為了阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓這傢伙欠個人情也不錯
Dialogue: 2,0:15:20.67,0:15:22.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳在笑什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:22.05,0:15:23.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒… 沒什麼！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.82,0:15:26.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,房間裡還有小雀的個人物品
Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.77,0:15:29.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只要別讓她隨便亂動就沒事了
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.27,0:15:30.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,接下來
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.52,0:15:31.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,開始動手吧
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.25,0:15:32.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.87,0:15:33.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要幹嘛？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:35.15,0:15:38.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,打掃呀 我來幫忙
Dialogue: 2,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不用了 我等等自己來就好！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:40.97,0:15:44.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是大哥在老家時雖然嘴上說會做
Dialogue: 2,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結果真正做的人是我啊
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.60,0:15:49.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唔… 是沒錯啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但最近有了會自動打掃的機器人
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.75,0:15:53.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒問題的啦
Dialogue: 2,0:15:53.87,0:15:55.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸 第一次看到
Dialogue: 2,0:15:56.02,0:15:59.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是角落裡積了很多灰塵喔
Dialogue: 2,0:16:00.22,0:16:01.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,完蛋！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:01.90,0:16:04.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-而且用水的地方會有很難清的汙垢\N-呼呼呼
Dialogue: 2,0:16:05.02,0:16:06.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,需要打掃訣竅呢
Dialogue: 2,0:16:06.37,0:16:07.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等等等一下啦
Dialogue: 2,0:16:10.65,0:16:12.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之妳別亂碰啦
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.87,0:16:15.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥看起來好像很不安
Dialogue: 2,0:16:15.80,0:16:16.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才… 才沒有咧
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.02,0:16:19.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有喔 大哥藏不住心事呀
Dialogue: 2,0:16:21.55,0:16:22.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可能被發現了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:24.60,0:16:27.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有什麼不想被看到的東西！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.10,0:16:29.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什… 什麼啦
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.60,0:16:32.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來… 是這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.95,0:16:35.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難道被發現了？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.47,0:16:37.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,完美無缺的隱形系統…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:37.45,0:16:39.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不 快想想怎麼補救
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.77,0:16:43.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥 你已經是成人了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.75,0:16:46.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會看“那種書”呢
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.85,0:16:47.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對不起喔 我這麼粗神經
Dialogue: 2,0:16:50.10,0:16:52.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會盡量不亂碰東西的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不… 不是啦
Dialogue: 2,0:16:53.47,0:16:54.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒關係啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我真的不會放在心上！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:56.45,0:16:57.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以說！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.82,0:17:01.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但這樣反而能利用這件事瞞過她
Dialogue: 2,0:17:01.65,0:17:02.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然不太情願
Dialogue: 2,0:17:03.65,0:17:04.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是妳想的那樣
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.35,0:17:07.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以妳別再東碰西碰了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:10.00,0:17:12.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那種書是什麼書呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,晚點去問爸爸吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:16.15,0:17:19.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,話說回來 妳真的沒變呢
Dialogue: 2,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥好像有點變了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:22.17,0:17:24.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,國中的時候總是離我遠點
Dialogue: 2,0:17:24.55,0:17:26.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別亂碰啦！別管我啦！這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:17:26.95,0:17:28.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別把人說得像在反抗期啦
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.90,0:17:32.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為和他人太接近\N只會讓我感到很累
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我要的是距離感
Dialogue: 2,0:17:34.90,0:17:37.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真希望大哥能遇到呢
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.92,0:17:40.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,能讓你感到\N“能讓你想永遠在一起的人”的人
Dialogue: 2,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.97,0:17:45.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:17:45.07,0:17:46.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會一直跟爸爸在一起吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.82,0:17:47.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:51.67,0:17:52.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不對啦 阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哪裡不對呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:54.37,0:17:57.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果有女朋友 那我就能放心啦
Dialogue: 2,0:17:58.05,0:18:00.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是大哥的優點很難看出來啊
Dialogue: 2,0:18:01.12,0:18:02.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別多管閒事啦
Dialogue: 2,0:18:03.42,0:18:04.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妹妹啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:05.27,0:18:07.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有這樣如此關心的人
Dialogue: 2,0:18:07.55,0:18:09.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓人有點羨慕呢
Dialogue: 2,0:18:14.65,0:18:15.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,換洗衣物？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:16.87,0:18:17.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,糟糕啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:18.25,0:18:19.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸？那是什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.20,0:18:22.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的 摺成這樣…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.75,0:18:23.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你看…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.67,0:18:30.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不… 不可以！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:35.30,0:18:37.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳… 妳好 初次見面
Dialogue: 2,0:18:42.87,0:18:46.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,和女性合租房間住在一起
Dialogue: 2,0:18:46.32,0:18:48.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,製作了少女機器人
Dialogue: 2,0:18:48.30,0:18:51.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,被稱為爸爸、媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.17,0:18:53.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然略過了細節
Dialogue: 2,0:18:53.90,0:18:56.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這說法未免太多吐槽點了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:18:56.50,0:18:57.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別慌張
Dialogue: 2,0:18:57.87,0:19:00.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,到了這地步 除了讓她接受別無他法
Dialogue: 2,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個 小時…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:04.47,0:19:05.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:05.82,0:19:06.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在哭？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.50,0:19:09.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥竟然交到了女朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:19:09.90,0:19:10.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,女朋友？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.52,0:19:13.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了保護女朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.47,0:19:17.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,連獨力摺衣服都做不到的大哥竟然…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.85,0:19:19.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夠啦 妳冷靜點
Dialogue: 2,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,冷靜點… 拜託妳
Dialogue: 2,0:19:22.27,0:19:24.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我懂你為什麼拿她沒辦法了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.82,0:19:26.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太耀眼了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.45,0:19:28.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就說她不是差勁的人啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:29.05,0:19:29.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 2,0:19:30.50,0:19:31.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 2,0:19:33.22,0:19:35.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小時接受剛才的說明了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:36.15,0:19:37.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,機器人什麼的
Dialogue: 2,0:19:37.20,0:19:39.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太艱深了不是很明白…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.10,0:19:43.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是為了保護阿爾瑪才隱瞞的吧
Dialogue: 2,0:19:43.97,0:19:47.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我能明白你有多重視她喔
Dialogue: 2,0:19:48.05,0:19:51.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的… 就說不是差勁的人啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:52.25,0:19:54.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小時 這件事…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:54.45,0:19:55.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 2,0:19:56.35,0:19:57.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀小姐
Dialogue: 2,0:20:00.37,0:20:02.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥就拜託妳了
Dialogue: 2,0:20:02.52,0:20:03.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 2,0:20:03.05,0:20:04.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 不 我才是…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:05.60,0:20:06.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是在拜託什麼啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:07.22,0:20:08.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給我冷靜！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:08.72,0:20:09.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,話說回來 妳們
Dialogue: 2,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,以前不是見過面嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:20:12.57,0:20:14.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊！難道說
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀小姐就是小學那時候…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:16.27,0:20:18.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊！啊哈哈
Dialogue: 2,0:20:18.10,0:20:19.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好久不見呀
Dialogue: 2,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想不起來
Dialogue: 2,0:20:22.05,0:20:23.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有 阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是神里時 是大哥…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:28.00,0:20:31.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,緣司的妹妹 請多指教喔
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.07,0:20:33.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請您多多指教
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.97,0:20:35.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姑媽
Dialogue: 2,0:20:42.05,0:20:42.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姑…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:45.15,0:20:46.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,父親的妹妹
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.70,0:20:49.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,從輩分來看是稱為“姑媽”對吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:49.32,0:20:50.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是沒錯啦
Dialogue: 2,0:20:50.65,0:20:52.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但不能叫高中女生“姑媽”啦
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.07,0:20:53.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姑…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.57,0:20:54.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小時 對不起啊
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.37,0:20:57.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是小時姑姑喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:57.42,0:20:58.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太強了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:20:59.37,0:21:02.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,之後好好地訂正了稱呼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:09.70,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:21:04.27,0:21:06.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,和小時姊成為好朋友了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.47,0:22:41.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小憩片刻
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.02,0:22:45.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,介紹我的哥哥
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.07,0:22:49.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,興趣是打掃 不喜歡樓梯
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.50,0:22:52.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,常常陪我玩 是很溫柔的哥哥
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.82,0:22:55.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總覺得你們好像喔
Dialogue: 2,0:22:55.57,0:22:57.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,果然是兄妹呢
Dialogue: 2,0:22:57.30,0:22:58.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.02,0:23:00.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎樣啦？
Dialogue: 2,0:23:01.15,0:23:03.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你跟小時不怎麼像呢
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.02,0:23:05.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,常被這樣說呢
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.87,0:23:06.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:23:07.12,0:23:10.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,個性和興趣也完全不一樣
Dialogue: 2,0:23:10.50,0:23:11.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.95,0:23:15.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但我很高興自己是大哥的妹妹喔
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.90,0:23:18.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,兄妹感覺好棒喔
Dialogue: 2,0:23:19.07,0:23:22.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀小姐也是我的“姊姊”呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.57,0:23:30.27,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（想像畫面）
Dialogue: 2,0:23:25.17,0:23:26.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊
Dialogue: 2,0:23:29.12,0:23:30.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.60,0:23:33.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽的瞳孔放大了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.35,0:23:36.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀小姐？喂？
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.60,0:23:38.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結束
